    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nChemung County, New York\n2 arrested on petit larceny charges in Chemung County\nBy Daniel Duric,\n2 hours agoELMIRA — Two people were arrested on petit larceny charges in separate incidents in Chemung County, according to Sheriff William A. Schrom. Marlea L. Redder, 36, of Elmira was arrested July 22 for petit larceny, a Class A misdemeanor, for stealing from Tops Market in the Town of Southport.",
